# Markdownlint Configuration
# Configure rules to match project standards

# Rule Configuration
rules "~MD013", "~MD029", "~MD001", "~MD002", "~MD022", "~MD031", "~MD032", "~MD012"

# Rule Explanations:
# MD001 - Header levels should only increment by one level at a time (disabled - AI sometimes generates H3 after H1)
# MD002 - First header should be a top level header (disabled - some docs start with H2 or H3)
# MD012 - Multiple consecutive blank lines (disabled - used for visual separation in large docs)
# MD013 - Line length (disabled - long URLs and code blocks exceed limits)
# MD022 - Headers should be surrounded by blank lines (disabled - compact formatting preference)
# MD029 - Ordered list item prefix (disabled - allows flexible numbering styles)
# MD031 - Fenced code blocks should be surrounded by blank lines (disabled - compact formatting)
# MD032 - Lists should be surrounded by blank lines (disabled - compact formatting)
